# Keep the build context to what the in-image Go build needs.
# The Dockerfile compiles from source, so only the gitignored / large local
# artefacts are dropped here — a clean clone builds without any of them.
#
# Build artefacts (regenerated inside the image, never COPYed):
bin/
certs/
data/
# Local ML assets: downloaded by the app at first start.
models/
# Secrets and VCS / transient state:
.env
.git
.freebuff
*.tmp
*.out
*.test
.DS_Store
